@startuml
[*] --> Waiting : Initial State
Waiting --> Active : Current date equals or surpasses start date
Active --> Expired : Finish date reached
Expired --> [*] : Final State (Rate is expired)
Expired --> Archived : One year from expiration date (optional)

note right of Expired
  The system marks the rate as expired once the finish date is reached.
end note

note left of Waiting
  The system shall keep the rate in a waiting state until the start date arrives.
end note

note right of Active
  The system shall maintain the rate's active state until the end of its validity period.
end note

@enduml
